   "install": {
    "title": "Getting Started",
    "html": "<p>Install vLLM with <a href=\"https://docs.astral.sh/uv/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><code>uv</code></a> (recommended) or <code>pip</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">uv pip install vllm\nvllm download-kernels  # precompiled kernels for faster startup\n</code></pre>\n<p>Or <a href=\"https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/getting_started/installation/gpu/index.html#build-wheel-from-source\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">build from source</a> for development.</p>\n<p>Visit our <a href=\"https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">documentation</a> to learn more.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/getting_started/installation.html\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Installation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/getting_started/quickstart.html\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Quickstart</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/models/supported_models.html\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">List of Supported Models</a></li>\n</ul>",
